Graphics presets while the game runs: 1x, 2x, 1x with the texture packs and
2x with them. rendererSetScale makes the EFB again at a new internal
resolution between frames (what reads it takes the scale as it goes, the XFB
and EFB copy textures follow their sizes, and the samplers whose LOD bias
follows the scale are made again); hiresSetActive draws the packs'
replacements or the originals, freeing the loaded ones when off, with the
packs still indexed (SMS_TEXTURE_PACKS_ACTIVE=0 starts with them off). On
the Switch, the left stick held in (L3) and D-pad Right step through the
presets, shown for a moment on screen and kept in graphics.txt beside the
program.

